{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790280660, "covers_from": "2026-09-24T20:11:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-24T20:12:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790280720, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-24T20:11:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 32474, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "臥龍街每到上學時間就會大塞車，每段綠燈都只能過兩三輛車，小小一段路可以卡十分鐘，真的太誇張", "display_name": "大安代表 No.32,474", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-24T20:11:14+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 32895, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "教育", "content": "一直出現虐童事件 \n希望市長真的能做出實際作為", "display_name": "信義代表 No.32,895", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-24T20:11:22+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3154, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "為什麼自行車道還要標記行人優先，很莫名", "display_name": "大安代表 No.3,154", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-24T20:11:28+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 39728, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "環境", "content": "希望傳統市場的衛生環境能變的像日本市場一樣，不會有魚腥氣味及地上濕黏跟老鼠亂串", "display_name": "南港代表 No.39,728", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-24T20:11:40+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 46799, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我希望可以騎腳踏車上下班，但車道設計實在太爛，行人走在腳踏車道卻不能按鈴，自有腳踏車沒有停放點", "display_name": "中山代表 No.46,799", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-24T20:11:55+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34214, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "其他", "content": "給沈伯洋一個機會改變台北市", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.34,214", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_numbe